  "title": "History of diesel engines | Cummins Inc.",
  "summary": "Rudolf Diesel and Clessie Cummins have many things in common. The most notable being their desire to find efficient solutions to problems with one goal in mind – making the world a better place. The invention of advanced diesel engines has continued and will continue to shape our world. With organizations like Cummins at the helm, advancements in diesel technology will undoubtedly propel us all into a safer and more prosperous future – something Rudolf Diesel and Clessie Cummins would be proud of.",
